=====================

  S~S The Elevator Pitch:   a demonstration and testing platform

------------------------------------------

    This SimpleSal App implements the use of ssTEA and ssUI functionality to test and demonstrate.

------------------------------------------

=====================

  S~S The purpose of the App:   app-fsmDemo

------------------------------------------

  Extensive documentation of app-fsmDemo can first be found within the files within the repo.

  The App purposefully was written to contain instances or examples of each type of ssTEA Event.
  The App also serves as an implementation and test platform for each of the ssTEA/ssUI OPTIN choices.

  Events are used together to implement FSMs whose only use or purpose is to demonstrate an idea.

  Resources are available to allow many Events to run simultaneous with the App.

    For example, 3 Events could be used to implement one-half of a network conversation, while
    3 other Events could be used to implement the other half. Both halves think they are alone.

    Both halves will run within app-fsmDemo, the network will exist of Data Events given Agency.

    When you write it.

------------------------------------------

